            "TableId": "/Game/UI/JournalData/Entries/ST_JournalEntries.ST_JournalEntries",
            "Key": "AdamantWateringCan",
            "SourceString": "When you stop to think about it, a watering can is an odd item. It's a rain-delayer. You're holding back a little rain for times when there isn't rain. It's kept in an adamant holding-cell until that moment that it's allowed to run free, when it gets a short moment of elation before being sucked up the roots of a plant. \r\n\r\nThat's weird, right? Or it just us? It's just us, isn't it. Ah darn it.",
